    "updated_at": "2023-02-24T13:16:26Z",
    "body": "As I just mentioned in another issue we're pretty bad about `file:` URLs in general. It's also not clear to me what useful thing we can say here as there are many aspects of cookies that are a poor fit for these URLs.\r\n\r\nI suppose we could try to more explicitly declare `file:` URLs as mostly out-of-scope.",
